{"id":"dc66c114284dcdc1","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace.md","title":"NPSPACE = PSPACE","display":"thm-npspace-equals-pspace — NPSPACE = PSPACE","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace","aliases":["28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace","NPSPACE equals PSPACE"],"display":"thm-npspace-equals-pspace — NPSPACE = PSPACE","depends_on":["[[28-df-npspace]]","[[28-df-pspace]]","[[28-thm-savitch]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace</span><span>NPSPACE equals PSPACE</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-npspace-equals-pspace — NPSPACE = PSPACE"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e88b5b361423eb7a\" href=\"?note=e88b5b361423eb7a\" title=\"28-df-npspace\">28-df-npspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"58e742656f0db590\" href=\"?note=58e742656f0db590\" title=\"28-thm-savitch\">28-thm-savitch</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NPSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf{NPSPACE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\)</span> 是本目录非确定型及确定型多项式工作空间类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NPSPACE}=\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NPSPACE}=\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>确定型机是非确定型机的特例，给出一向包含。反向对每个多项式空间界应用 Savitch，平方后仍是多项式，取并即得结论。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§4.2.1；印刷85–86页；PDF111–112页。原书推论及本地并类推导已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-npspace","status":"resolved","id":"e88b5b361423eb7a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-npspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-savitch","status":"resolved","id":"58e742656f0db590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-savitch]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NPSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NPSPACE}=\\mathbf{PSPACE}.","display":true}],"bytes":880,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层次结论：[[28-thm-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-p-neq-exp]]、[[28-thm-savitch]]、[[28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace]]、[[28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi]]。"}],"outgoing":["e88b5b361423eb7a","fd829148f31abddc","58e742656f0db590"]}